<title>OMAN: Oman International Bank net sharply higher.</title>
<headline>Oman International Bank net sharply higher.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(million Omani rials unless stated, rounded)</p>
<p>    Net profit for the year	  10.79     vs    6.95</p>
<p>    Net interest income		22.49     vs   21.61</p>
<p>    Provisions			    0.61     vs    1.63</p>
<p>Full name: Oman International Bank SAOG</p>
<p>Note: The bank said seven branches were opened in 1996. Two more opened in early 1997 and another five were to be launched later this year.</p>
<p>&quot;Our target is to increase our capital and reserves to around 65 million rials through a stock dividend for 1996 of 30 percent, and a new issue of 15 million rials, of which 60 percent will be available to existing shareholders and 40 percent to the public,&quot; the company said in a statement.</p>
</text>
